for. But, now I'm rethinking, will it look like a string on my big hand? Should I go for a wider band? \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blueplanet46@outlook.com","IpAddress":"85.203.45.28","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1466415860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287201.jpg?_r=1466416122","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":140,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Rays123","Id":287201,"Name":"Rays123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"116.58.205.101","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39e9105447eb8743f7da4f6c1ff8f2d7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;How much it will cost for the whole band your hired?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914487,"PostDate":1466507611,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>How much it will cost for the whole band your hired?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"f.dernando@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"116.58.200.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1466301901,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kellian","Id":287193,"Name":"Kellian","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"117.247.211.203","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"189d765cff73098927107ce903796fbe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;It is slightly looking like a band, if in the same price you get bigger ring than this one, then for sure go for that.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914503,"PostDate":1466584442,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It is slightly looking like a band, if in the same price you get bigger ring than this one, then for sure go for that.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vanessahodge26@gmail.com","IpAddress":"117.247.211.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465807953,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Venessa26","Id":287136,"Name":"Venessa26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.185.152","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e257cc0a00c0f2d8cbd9b9e683802aa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"Rays123\"],&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m actually thinking of a thin ring myself. &amp;nbsp;I suggest you try on your wedding ring before buying because you never know how it actually looks on your hand until you try it on.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914511,"PostDate":1466621667,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287201\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287201-rays123\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Rays123<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>I'm actually thinking of a thin ring myself. \u00a0I suggest you try on your wedding ring before buying because you never know how it actually looks on your hand until you try it on.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falleneight@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.26.14.237","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441731031,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284728.jpg?_r=1448387511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"OttawaBride2017","Id":284728,"Name":"OttawaBride2017","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
