ning on arriving early or to stay late to make your trip a real vacation. Whatever your travel needs may be Teresa is ready to assist you![\/size][\/center][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1336435,"PostDate":1289450460,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> Definitely will use this wording! Thanks!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Teira1031<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> this is what i have on my invitation\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: estrangelo edessa\">To insure the best possible pricing and inclusion in our group booking, we are providing contact information to our wedding travel agent and encourage you to take advantage of her services.\u00a0 Her packages include round-trip airfare, ground transportation to the resort and hotel accommodations.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: estrangelo edessa\">Teresa Stauring<br \/> Vacations 4 Less<\/span><br \/> <a href='mailto:tstauring@vacations4less.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=