1\" post=\"1289059\" timestamp=\"1284694485\"]\nthis is what i have on my invitation \n\n\n\n[center][size=4][font=&#039;estrangelo edessa&#039;]To insure the best possible pricing and inclusion in our group booking, we are providing contact information to our wedding travel agent and encourage you to take advantage of her services.  Her packages include round-trip airfare, ground transportation to the resort and hotel accommodations.[\/font][\/size][\/center]\n[center][size=4][font=&#039;estrangelo edessa&#039;]Teresa Stauring\nVacations 4 Less[\/font]\n[email=\"tstauring@vacations4less.com\"]tstauring@vacations4less.com[\/email]\n800-200-2423 ext. 202\n323-655-8434\n323-655-1103 fax[\/size][\/center]\n[center][size=4][font=&#039;estrangelo edessa&#039;]We will be arriving Monday, April 4[\/font][sup]th[\/sup]but know many of you are planning on arriving early or to stay late to make your trip a real vacation. Whatever your travel needs may be Teresa is ready to assist you![\/size][\/center][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1841489,"PostDate":1396281091,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is what I'm planning on using now!! Thank you for sharing!!<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Teira1031, on 16 September 2010 - 07:34 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>this is what i have on my invitation\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'estrangelo edessa';\">To insure the best possible pricing and inclusion in our group booking, we are providing contact information to our wedding travel agent and encourage you to take advantage of her services.\u00a0 Her packages include round-trip airfare, ground transportation to the resort and hotel accommodations.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'estrangelo edessa';\">Teresa Stauring<br>\nVacations 4 Less<\/span><br><a href='mailto:tstauring@vacations4less.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span>tstauring@vacations4less.com<\/span><\/a><br>\n800-200-2423 ext. 202<br>\n323-655-8434<br>\n323-655-1103 fax<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'estrangelo edessa';\">We will be arriving Monday, April 4<\/span><sup>th<\/sup>but know many of you are planning on arriving early or to stay late to make your trip a real vacation. Whatever your travel needs may be Teresa is ready to assist you!<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bambiderby@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1395176260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277216.jpg?_r=1395766815","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":218,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"forevertogether","Id":277216,"Name":"forevertogether","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.148.164","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":56874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"Ed