t-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hello ladies...&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;I will be getting married in Cancun in April of 2016 at Secrets The Vine Cancun. I pretty much have everything booked expect hair and makeup. I have been in contact with a few vendors. However, Backstage Hair and Makeup caught my eye. I would like to know if anyone has used them for their hair and makeup? Or possibly any recommendations. I am nervous about booking Backstage because I want to make sure they are legit. Any recommendations will help.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; :D&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;Thank you!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910491,"PostDate":1454528511,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">Hello ladies...<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">I will be getting married in Cancun in April of 2016 at Secrets The Vine Cancun. I pretty much have everything booked expect hair and makeup. I have been in contact with a few vendors. However, Backstage Hair and Makeup caught my eye. I would like to know if anyone has used them for their hair and makeup? Or possibly any recommendations. I am nervous about booking Backstage because I want to make sure they are legit. Any recommendations will help.\u00a0<\/span><\/span>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">Thank you!!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ellanamariah@aol.com","IpAddress":"108.29.158.190","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1454527969,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ellanamariah","Id":286124,"Name":"ellanamariah","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.15.136.26","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79919,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f93d20d8c33ea2f2a6db5eda0341ad69","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I dont know Backstage, but i am getting married at Dreams Tulum April 2016 (yeah) and have MVP booked. &amp;nbsp;They have gotten back to me promptly on every email i have sent. &amp;nbsp;Great reviews on this site and their work on Facebook is amazing. &amp;nbsp;I am splurging for Melissa. &amp;nbsp;But if you dont want to pay that, Team MVP is her prodigies.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;good luck and congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Kim&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910881,"PostDate":1455542073,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I dont know Backstage, but i am getting married at Dreams Tulum April 2016 (yeah) and have MVP booked. \u00a0They have gotten back to me promptly on every email i have sent. \u00a0Great reviews on this site and their work on Facebook is amazing. \u00a0I am splurging for Melissa. \u00a0But if you dont want to pay that, Team MVP is her prodigies.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>good luck and congrats!<\/p>\n<p>Kim<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmykillelea@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"12.15.136.26","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401895078,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278247.jpg?_r=1465938196","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"fluffykim","Id":278247,"Name":"fluffykim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.112.93.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79919,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7343db0fb91c4d4613ea69cdb2b8f7c","RawContent":"How did you end up liking your hair and makeup? Did you get Melissa?","Attachments":[],"Id":1914398,"PostDate":1465965765,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                How did you end up liking your hair and makeup? Did you get Melissa?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hockeynutt3828@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.112.93.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465964420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"hockeynutt","Id":287166,"Name":"hockeynutt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.44.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79919,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 15 June 2016 - 10:02 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1466028151,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4147c284aca4167979e2b0004aa6a900","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community ellanamariah, and Congrats on your upcoming Secrets the Vine Cancun wedding!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve worked weddings with &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/voevolution&#039;&gt;Vo Evolution Wedding Hair &amp;amp; Makeup &lt;\/a&gt;and can highly recommend them as their artistry is impeccable!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the very best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter team :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s what we&#039;re talking about ~ when they beautified this bridal party at their &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Grand-Palladium-Wedding-UK-with-Love\/k7mfu\/56d852280cf25a66a5365043&#039;&gt;Grand Palladium Wedding - just Beautiful!!!&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_5f12d68d0c0f4cb2bc68cd77931a4ff7.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_5f12d68d0c0f4cb2bc68cd77931a4ff7.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_5f12d68d0c0f4cb2bc68cd77931a4ff7.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_1f137752dc234bbf965881f1b72704ce.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_1f137752dc234bbf965881f1b72704ce.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_1f137752dc234bbf965881f1b72704ce.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_93955fa84b64425cbb2579815f88fb77.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_93955fa84b64425cbb2579815f88fb77.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_93955fa84b64425cbb2579815f88fb77.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914412,"PostDate":1466028102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community ellanamariah, and Congrats on your upcoming Secrets the Vine Cancun wedding!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We've worked weddings with <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/voevolution' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Vo Evolution Wedding Hair & Makeup <\/a>and can highly recommend them as their artistry is impeccable!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the very best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's what we're talking about ~ when they beautified this bridal party at their <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Grand-Palladium-Wedding-UK-with-Love\/k7mfu\/56d852280cf25a66a5365043' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Palladium Wedding - just Beautiful!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_5f12d68d0c0f4cb2bc68cd77931a4ff7.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_5f12d68d0c0f4cb2bc68cd77931a4ff7.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_5f12d68d0c0f4cb2bc68cd77931a4ff7.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_1f137752dc234bbf965881f1b72704ce.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_1f137752dc234bbf965881f1b72704ce.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_1f137752dc234bbf965881f1b72704ce.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_93955fa84b64425cbb2579815f88fb77.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_93955fa84b64425cbb2579815f88fb77.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_93955fa84b64425cbb2579815f88fb77.\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79919","Title":"Cancun Hair And Makeup","LastPostDate":1466028102},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
